  <item>
    <title>E.6 素子：游戏开发散伙是常态，良渚却能聚集人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/685d2a9208d8fd858622e35a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">685d2a9208d8fd858622e35a</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 27 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这段对话发生在2025年5月，杭州良渚文化村。</span></p><span></span><p><span>素子之前在腾讯做游戏开发程序员。离开大厂之后，陆续前往多个数字游民社区生活，最后选择定居在良渚。目前她在良渚做自媒体和独立游戏开发的尝试。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们聊了聊游戏开发者的打工生涯，以及在良渚不上班的生活。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🍠</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/63c0b7240000000026012240?xsec_token=YBlpoFouERCeJ5mamdqa9pREkZd5pti5ovGsd3uPmGW7E=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=63c0b7240000000026012240&amp;apptime=1750839331&amp;share_id=56d9eb7fa15e4282aae39ccac87f2c0c&amp;wechatWid=146f7a42fb74e3ec1e7a0de1405859e2&amp;wechatOrigin=menu" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/63c0b7240000000026012240?xsec_token=YBlpoFouERCeJ5mamdqa9pREkZd5pti5ovGsd3uPmGW7E=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=63c0b7240000000026012240&amp;apptime=1750839331&amp;share_id=56d9eb7fa15e4282aae39ccac87f2c0c&amp;wechatWid=146f7a42fb74e3ec1e7a0de1405859e2&amp;wechatOrigin=menu"><span>素子小红书账号</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>⬇️时间线：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 1&nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="28">00:00:28</a> 素子的工作：远程游戏团队工作 + 良渚线下社群构建</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="49">00:00:49</a> 启师傅的独立开发者天堂：杭州良渚小圈子demday</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">00:03:30</a> 职业转型样本：从「厂里打工人」到自媒体创作者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="726">00:12:06</a> 从玩家到职业者：游戏爱好者的华丽转身</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1853">00:30:53</a> 数字游民觉醒：按部就班的生活已不再适合</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2122">00:35:22</a> 良渚：数字游民乐土 + 科技创业者天堂</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 2&nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="419">00:06:59</a> 戏剧性职场事件：公司老板被下毒，堪比悬疑大片！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1008">00:16:48</a> 大厂生活双面镜：高薪福利 vs 「让人丧」的日常</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1071">00:17:51</a> 裁员过山车：同事被裁，我却留下，心情复杂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1240">00:20:40</a> 职场真需求：冰激凌和福利填不满的「内心空洞」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1348">00:22:28</a> 团队定位的齿轮感：人人工具化，层级相似却本质相同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1525">00:25:25</a> 职场第一天最快乐？后面全是工具人压力</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;Part 3</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2746">00:45:46</a> 播客创作有方法论吗？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3148">00:52:28</a> 创作焦虑的魔法钥匙：调整心情后过敏奇迹康复</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>如果你也有故事想要分享，欢迎联系我们，参与节目录制。</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信：heishi121</span></p>]]></description>
